#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This app makes scheduling intuitive for customers and efficient for your "
"team. Whether it’s a small group or a company team-building event, players "
"can choose their preferred slot, answer custom questions, and receive "
"instant confirmations. It’s all synced behind the scenes with room capacity."
msgstr ""
"Ta aplikacija strankam omogoča intuitivno rezervacijo terminov, vaši ekipi "
"pa učinkovito organizacijo. Ne glede na to, ali gre za majhno skupino ali "
"ekipni dogodek podjetja, lahko igralci izberejo želeni termin, odgovorijo na "
"vprašanja po meri in takoj prejmejo potrditve. Vse je v ozadju "
"sinhronizirano z zmogljivostjo prostora."

