#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:escape_rooms.appointment_type_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Welcome to Sublevel 9 — a black-site research facility buried deep beneath "
"the desert. Officially, it doesn’t exist. But inside, cryogenic chambers "
"hum, electromagnetic locks twitch, and the remains of <em>Specimen X</em> "
"are stirring."
msgstr ""
"Dobrodošli v podnivoju 9 — tajnem raziskovalnem objektu, zakopanem globoko "
"pod puščavo. Uradno ne obstaja. Toda znotraj brnijo kriogenske komore, "
"elektromagnetne ključavnice trzajo, ostanki <em>vzorca X</em> pa se "
"prebujajo."

#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:escape_rooms.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With Odoo, your escape room operations aren't just automated — they’re "
"leveled up. Curious how far you can go? Let’s open the next door. 🗝️"
msgstr ""
"Z Odoojem vaše poslovanje s sobami pobega ni le avtomatizirano – dvignjeno "
"je na višjo raven. Vas zanima, kako daleč lahko greste? Odprimo naslednja "
"vrata. 🗝️"

#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:escape_rooms.ir_ui_view_3247
#, fuzzy
msgid "X"
msgstr "X"

#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:escape_rooms.appointment_type_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You and your crew have been hired to wipe the lab clean before it’s "
"decommissioned. What begins as a simple extraction mission quickly turns "
"into a fight for survival. Someone — or something — has reactivated the "
"systems. The security\n"
"          lockdown is in place. The experiment is awake."
msgstr ""
"Vi in vaša ekipa ste bili najeti, da pred razgradnjo laboratorij očistite do "
"zadnje sledi. Kar se začne kot preprosta misija izvleka, se hitro spremeni v "
"boj za preživetje. Nekdo — ali nekaj — je znova aktiviral sisteme. "
"Varnostna\n"
"          zapora je vzpostavljena. Eksperiment je buden."

#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:escape_rooms.ir_ui_view_3760
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can, but keep in mind that fewer players means more puzzles per person! "
"If you’re up for the challenge, it’s totally doable — just know that some "
"tasks might take longer or require extra cleverness with a smaller group."
msgstr ""
"Lahko, vendar imejte v mislih, da manj igralcev pomeni več ugank na osebo! "
"Če ste pripravljeni na izziv, je to povsem izvedljivo — le vedite, da lahko "
"nekatere naloge z manjšo skupino trajajo dlje ali zahtevajo dodatno "
"iznajdljivost."

#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:escape_rooms.appointment_type_4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You have 60 minutes to stop a catastrophe. Cut the right wire — or cut the "
"world short."
msgstr ""
"Imate 60 minut, da preprečite katastrofo. Prerežite pravo žico — ali pa "
"skrajšajte svetu življenje."

#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:escape_rooms.homepage
msgid ""
"Your Dynamic Snippet will be displayed here... This message is displayed "
"because you did not provide both a filter and a template to use.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"Vaš dinamični delček kode bo prikazan tukaj ... To sporočilo se prikaže, ker "
"niste navedli niti filtra niti predloge za uporabo.\n"
"<br/>"

#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:escape_rooms.appointment_type_1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your team has been summoned by the great detective’s confidante to step into "
"his study, filled with hidden compartments, cryptic clues, and mechanical "
"puzzles beyond imagination. Every object has meaning. Every second counts."
msgstr ""
"Zaupnica velikega detektiva je vašo ekipo poklicala, naj vstopi v njegovo "
"delovno sobo, polno skritih predalov, skrivnostnih namigov in mehanskih "
"ugank, ki presegajo domišljijo. Vsak predmet ima svoj pomen. Vsaka sekunda "
"šteje."

#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:escape_rooms.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your website becomes the control room of your escape business — not just a "
"digital brochure. Customize landing pages, link directly to your scheduler, "
"and turn curiosity into confirmed bookings. The site is fully responsive,\n"
"            multilingual, and SEO-friendly."
msgstr ""
"Vaša spletna stran postane nadzorna soba vašega podjetja za sobe pobega — ne "
"le digitalna brošura. Prilagodite ciljne strani, neposredno povežite svoj "
"razporejevalnik in spremenite radovednost v potrjene rezervacije. Spletno "
"mesto je v celoti odzivno,\n"
"            večjezično in optimizirano za SEO."

#. module: escape_rooms
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:escape_rooms.appointment_type_4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You’re a special ops team sent to infiltrate the facility. But nothing goes "
"to plan. Time is against you. The launch sequence has already begun. "
"Somewhere in this bunker lies the abort protocol — buried under layers of "
"Soviet\n"
"          encryption, locked cabinets, and long-forgotten codes."
msgstr ""
"Ste ekipa za posebne operacije, poslana, da se infiltrira v objekt. Toda nič "
"ne gre po načrtu. Čas vam ni naklonjen. Zaporedje izstrelitve se je že "
"začelo. Nekje v tem bunkerju je protokol za prekinitev — zakopan pod plastmi "
"sovjetskega\n"
"          šifriranja, zaklenjenimi omarami in davno pozabljenimi kodami."

